of inequalities shown below:\n$$H_{\\lambda^k}= \\left \\{h \\in \\mathbb{R}^n \\mid h(i)-\\sum_{j=1}^{n-1}p_{ij}(a)h(j)\\le r(i,a)-\\lambda^k, \\forall i \\in S, \\forall a\\in A(i) \\right\\},$$\nwhich is equivalent to $H_{\\lambda^k} = \\{ h \\in \\mathbb{R}^n \\mid h \\le T_{\\lambda^k} h \\}$.\n\nThe Gauss-Seidel variant of the operator, $T_{GS_{\\lambda^k}}$, is defined by its application $h^{k+1}=T_{GS_{\\lambda^k}}{h^k}$ where:\n$$h^{k+1}(i)=\\min_{a\\in{A(i)}}\\left\\{r(i,a)-\\lambda^k+\\sum_{j<i} p_{ij}(a) h^{k+1}(j)+ \\sum_{j \\geq i}^{n-1} p_{ij}(a) h^k(j) \\right\\}, \\forall i\\in \\overline{1,n}.$$\n\nLet the set $H_{GS_{\\lambda^k}}$ be defined as:\n$$H_{GS_{\\lambda^k}}=\\{h\\in\\mathbb{R}^{n}\\mid h\\le T_{GS_{\\lambda^k}}{h}\\}.$$\n\nThe following lemmas are required to prove the main theorem.\n\n**Lemma 19 (Monotonicity)**\n1. If $h \\ge g$, then for any $\\lambda^k$, $T_{\\lambda^k}h \\ge T_{\\lambda^k}g$ and $T_{GS_{\\lambda^k}} h \\ge T_{GS_{\\lambda^k}} g$.\n2. If $h > g$, then for any $\\lambda^k$, $T_{\\lambda^k}h > T_{\\lambda^k}g$ and $T_{GS_{\\lambda^k}} h > T_{GS_{\\lambda^k}} g$.\n\n**Lemma 15**\nThe following relation holds:\n$$H_{\\lambda^k}\\subset{H_{GS_{\\lambda^k}}}.$$\n\n**Lemma 17**\n$$T_{GS_{\\lambda^k}}( H_{GS_{\\lambda^k}}) \\subset H_{\\lambda^k}.$$\n## Theorem\n**Theorem 18**\nThe set $H_{\\lambda^k}$ is invariant under $T_{GS_{\\lambda^k}}$. That is, $T_{GS_{\\lambda^k}}(H_{\\lambda^k}) \\subset H_{\\lambda^k}$.', 'status': 'ACCEPT', 'result': {'status': 'ACCEPT', 'rejection_reason': None, 'justification': 'This is a well-formed mathematical proof request in English. It provides complete setup with all necessary definitions, notation, and three required lemmas (19, 15, and 17) to prove Theorem 18 about invariance properties of sets under Gauss-Seidel operators in Markov decision processes. No PII, no safety issues, no image generation, no real-time data needed.'}, 'accepted': True, 'error': None, 'token_usage': {'gemini': {'input_tokens': 0, 'output_tokens': 0, 'cached_tokens': 0, 'cost_usd': 0.0}, 'openai': {'input_tokens': 0, 'output_tokens': 0, 'cached_tokens': 0, 'cost_usd': 0.0}, 'kimi': {'input_tokens': 1473, 'output_tokens': 109, 'cached_tokens': 0, 'cost_usd': 0.004254}, 'total_cost_usd': 0.004254}, 'token_usage_cumulative': {'gemini': {'input_tokens': 0, 'output_tokens': 0, 'cached_tokens': 0, 'cost_usd': 0.0}, 'openai': {'input_tokens': 0, 'output_tokens': 0, 'cached_tokens': 0, 'cost_usd': 0.0}, 'kimi': {'input_tokens': 1473, 'output_tokens': 109, 'cached_tokens': 0, 'cost_usd': 0.004254}, 'total_cost_usd': 0.004254}}] 
