ded density... needed for the Taylor expansion and guarantees the tail sum converges.' However, the confirmation of tower property/conditional expectation usage is brief—mentioned implicitly via 'E|X̄_n|=O(1) keeps the spacing uniformly O(ϱ)' but not explicit about tower property. Considered fault: The tower property/conditional expectation justification is implicit rather than explicit."}, 'ophelia': {'score': 5, 'reason': "Has '## Verification' section. Confirms O(ϱ²) bound: 'the cancellation of the first-order term in (1) – a direct consequence of the antisymmetry... The remaining term involves the derivative of the conditional density and a factor u_k³.' Confirms Assumption 1 usage explicitly: 'Assumption 1 is used twice: (1) it guarantees that the conditional density... is bounded and has a bounded derivative... (2) it ensures finite moments of Z̃_n.' However, the tower property/conditional expectation is not explicitly confirmed as a justification step—it's implicit in the proof structure. Considered fault: Missing explicit mention of tower property/conditional expectation in Verification."}, 'gemini': {'score': 3, 'reason': "Has '**Verification**' section (bold, not '## Verification'). Confirms O(ϱ²) origins and mentions Assumption 1. However, the section title fails the exact format requirement. Additionally, the confirmation of how Assumption 1 is used is somewhat vague—mentions 'bind the density function's derivatives' but doesn't explicitly confirm the tower property or conditional expectation steps. Considered fault: Section title format incorrect; tower property/conditional expectation confirmation missing."}, 'gpt': {'score': 6, 'reason': "Has exactly '## Verification' section. Confirms O(ϱ²) bound with explicit mechanism: 'Cell symmetry of round-to-nearest-even... makes the constant (first-order) part cancel exactly' and 'first non-cancelling contribution arises from variation of the density... giving a cell contribution proportional to Δ³f′(m)... net