ration of σ and π sector analysis', 'description': 'GPT 5.2 uses explicit section headers and structured analysis treating σ and π electrons as distinct sectors with separate electron counting, while the SxS winner combines these in a single paragraph.', 'scale': '1-6 scale: 1-2 = mentions both sectors; 3-4 = organized treatment with clear separation; 5-6 = rigorous sector-by-sector analysis with explicit coupling between them', 'rating': 4}, {'name': 'LaTeX formatting of displayed equations', 'description': 'GPT 5.2 uses proper LaTeX display math environments with \\[...\\] delimiters for multi-line equations and boxed final result, while the SxS winner uses inline $...$ even for complex expressions and lacks visual emphasis of the conclusion.', 'scale': '1-6 scale: 1-2 = basic LaTeX present; 3-4 = proper display environments; 5-6 = professional mathematical typesetting with structural clarity', 'rating': 4}], 'sxs_winner_label': 'Response B', 'token_usage': {'gemini': {'input_tokens': 0, 'output_tokens': 0, 'cached_tokens': 0, 'cost_usd': 0.0}, 'openai': {'input_tokens': 0, 'output_tokens': 0, 'cached_tokens': 0, 'cost_usd': 0.0}, 'kimi': {'input_tokens': 26171, 'output_tokens': 4895, 'cached_tokens': 0, 'cost_usd': 0.111082}, 'total_cost_usd': 0.111082}, 'token_usage_cumulative': {'gemini': {'input_tokens': 0, 'output_tokens': 0, 'cached_tokens': 0, 'cost_usd': 0.0}, 'openai': {'input_tokens': 0, 'output_tokens': 0, 'cached_tokens': 0, 'cost_usd': 0.0}, 'kimi': {'input_tokens': 26171, 'output_tokens': 4895, 'cached_tokens': 0, 'cost_usd': 0.111082}, 'total_cost_usd': 0.111082}}] 
