rs $$...$$ for all major equations, while the SxS winner mixes inline and display formatting with occasional awkward spacing.', 'scale': '1-6 scale: 1-2 = minor formatting preference, 3-4 = noticeably more professional presentation, 5-6 = substantially superior readability', 'rating': 3}], 'rubrics_vs_gpt': [], 'sxs_winner_label': 'Response A', 'token_usage': {'gemini': {'input_tokens': 0, 'output_tokens': 0, 'cached_tokens': 0, 'cost_usd': 0.0}, 'openai': {'input_tokens': 0, 'output_tokens': 0, 'cached_tokens': 0, 'cost_usd': 0.0}, 'kimi': {'input_tokens': 27357, 'output_tokens': 3729, 'cached_tokens': 0, 'cost_usd': 0.099462}, 'total_cost_usd': 0.099462}, 'token_usage_cumulative': {'gemini': {'input_tokens': 0, 'output_tokens': 0, 'cached_tokens': 0, 'cost_usd': 0.0}, 'openai': {'input_tokens': 0, 'output_tokens': 0, 'cached_tokens': 0, 'cost_usd': 0.0}, 'kimi': {'input_tokens': 27357, 'output_tokens': 3729, 'cached_tokens': 0, 'cost_usd': 0.099462}, 'total_cost_usd': 0.099462}}] 
