= 0.\n$$\n\n**Assumption 3**\nFor $x \\in [0,1]$, define the sequence of coefficient measures,\n$$\n\\mu_N(dx) := \\sum_{k=0}^{N-1} \\delta\\left(x - \\frac{k}{N}\\right) c_{k,N}^2\n$$\nwhere $\\delta(x)$ is the Dirac $\\delta$-distribution. There exists a nonnegative finite Radon measure $\\mu$ on the interval $[0,1]$ such that $\\mu_N \\to \\mu$ weakly.\n\nFor the large-$t$ asymptotic statements, we say that a function $g(t)$ satisfies $g(t) \\sim t^\\nu$ if $\\lim_{t \\to \\infty} g(t) / t^\\nu = C$ for some nonnegative constant $C$.\n## Theorem\n**Theorem 1**\nLet the sets of processes $\\{x_N(t)\\}$ and $\\{z_{k,N}(t)\\}$ be defined as in the setup. Take $z_{k,N}(0) = 0$ for all $k$ and $N$. Suppose that the diffusive spectrum $\\{\\lambda_{k,N}\\}$ converges to a shape function $f$ in the sense of Assumption 1. Furthermore, suppose the coefficients $\\{c_{k,N}\\}$ satisfy Assumption 3 with limiting weight measure $\\mu$.\n\nThen the family $\\{x_N(t)\\}$ converges in distribution as $N \\to \\infty$ to a mean zero Gaussian process $x(t)$ defined by its auto-correlation function\n$$\n\\mathbb{E}[x(t) x(s)] = \\int_0^1 \\frac{e^{-f(x)|t-s|}}{2 f(x)} \\left(1 - e^{-2 f(x) (t \\wedge s)}\\right) \\mu(dx).\n$$\nIf the shape function $f$ furthermore satisfies Assumption 2 with spectral parameter $\\rho > 0$ and the limiting weight measure $\\mu$ is Lebesgue measure, then asymptotically, the limiting mean-squared displacement (MSD) function $\\text{msd}(t) := \\mathbb{E}[x^2(t)]$ satisfies\n$$\n\\text{msd}(t) \\sim t, \\quad t \\to 0\n$$\nand\n$$\n\\text{msd}(t) \\sim \\left\\{ \\begin{array} {cc} t^{1 - \\frac{1}{\\rho}} & \\rho > 1 \\\\ \\ln t & \\rho = 1 \\\\ 1 & 0 < \\rho < 1 \\end{array}\\right. \\quad t \\to \\infty\n$$', 'status': 'ACCEPT', 'result': {'status': 'ACCEPT', 'rejection_reason': None, 'justification': 'This is a legitimate mathematical proof request involving stochastic processes (Ornstein-Uhlenbeck processes). The prompt contains complete mathematical definitions, assumptions, and a theorem statement to prove. No images are requested, all reference material is provided, content is safe and academic in nature, text is coherent English, no PII is present, no real-time data is needed, no identity questions are asked, and no financial data is requested.'}, 'accepted': True, 'error': None, 'token_usage': {'gemini': {'input_tokens': 0, 'output_tokens': 0, 'cached_tokens': 0, 'cost_usd': 0.0}, 'openai': {'input_tokens': 0, 'output_tokens': 0, 'cached_tokens': 0, 'cost_usd': 0.0}, 'kimi': {'input_tokens': 1583, 'output_tokens': 115, 'cached_tokens': 0, 'cost_usd': 0.004546}, 'total_cost_usd': 0.004546}, 'token_usage_cumulative': {'gemini': {'input_tokens': 0, 'output_tokens': 0, 'cached_tokens': 0, 'cost_usd': 0.0}, 'openai': {'input_tokens': 0, 'output_tokens': 0, 'cached_tokens': 0, 'cost_usd': 0.0}, 'kimi': {'input_tokens': 1583, 'output_tokens': 115, 'cached_tokens': 0, 'cost_usd': 0.004546}, 'total_cost_usd': 0.004546}}] 
