le: 1-2 = minor addition, 3-4 = meaningful metamathematical transparency, 5-6 = significantly superior scholarly rigor', 'rating': 5}, {'name': 'LaTeX display math for key equations', 'description': 'GPT 5.2 uses proper display math environments (\\[...\\] or $$...$$) for important equations like nx = ng(1) = g(n) = f(n) = a, while the SxS winner compresses key steps into inline math or running text.', 'scale': '1-6 scale: 1-2 = minor typesetting preference, 3-4 = improved readability of key steps, 5-6 = substantially better mathematical presentation', 'rating': 3}, {'name': 'Verification of well-definedness for extension map', 'description': 'GPT 5.2 explicitly verifies that the extended homomorphism F is well-defined and checks that F(kn) = f(kn) with a clear chain of equalities, while the SxS winner states well-definedness more tersely in a parenthetical remark at the end.', 'scale': '1-6 scale: 1-2 = slightly more detail, 3-4 = clearer verification step, 5-6 = substantially more rigorous verification', 'rating': 3}], 'sxs_winner_label': 'Response A', 'token_usage': {'gemini': {'input_tokens': 0, 'output_tokens': 0, 'cached_tokens': 0, 'cost_usd': 0.0}, 'openai': {'input_tokens': 0, 'output_tokens': 0, 'cached_tokens': 0, 'cost_usd': 0.0}, 'kimi': {'input_tokens': 17963, 'output_tokens': 4030, 'cached_tokens': 0, 'cost_usd': 0.084286}, 'total_cost_usd': 0.084286}, 'token_usage_cumulative': {'gemini': {'input_tokens': 0, 'output_tokens': 0, 'cached_tokens': 0, 'cost_usd': 0.0}, 'openai': {'input_tokens': 0, 'output_tokens': 0, 'cached_tokens': 0, 'cost_usd': 0.0}, 'kimi': {'input_tokens': 17963, 'output_tokens': 4030, 'cached_tokens': 0, 'cost_usd': 0.084286}, 'total_cost_usd': 0.084286}}] 
