rehensive roadmap with all key transformations', 'rating': 5}, {'name': 'Change of variables to standard Dirichlet energy', 'description': 'Gemini 3 Pro explicitly performs the change of variables g = f_t^{q/2} to transform the Fisher information into standard Dirichlet energy form before applying LSI.', 'scale': '1-6 scale: 1-2 = mentions change of variables, 3-4 = performs substitution with partial details, 5-6 = complete derivation with gradient computation and substitution', 'rating': 6}, {'name': 'LSI applied to transformed function', 'description': 'Gemini 3 Pro applies the Log-Sobolev Inequality to the transformed function g = f_t^{q/2} rather than to the original density ratio.', 'scale': '1-6 scale: 1-2 = applies LSI to original variables, 3-4 = mentions transformation but applies LSI unclearly, 5-6 = clean application of LSI to g with correct entropy form', 'rating': 5}, {'name': 'Explicit KL divergence identification', 'description': 'Gemini 3 Pro explicitly identifies the integral as the KL divergence of the q-twisted measure μ_q with respect to ν.', 'scale': '1-6 scale: 1-2 = implicit recognition, 3-4 = mentions KL without formal definition, 5-6 = explicit definition of μ_q and identification as KL(μ_q||ν)', 'rating': 5}, {'name': 'Verification section for q → 1 limit', 'description': 'Gemini 3 Pro includes a dedicated verification section checking consistency with the known q → 1 limit (KL divergence with rate 2α).', 'scale': '1-6 scale: 1-2 = brief mention of limit, 3-4 = computes limit with some details, 5-6 = complete verification matching known results', 'rating': 6}, {'name': 'Discussion of implicit assumptions', 'description': 'Gemini 3 Pro includes a section explicitly discussing where full support and smoothness assumptions are used in the proof.', 'scale': '1-6 scale: 1-2 = mentions assumptions exist, 3-4 = discusses some uses, 5-6 = detailed analysis of specific proof steps requiring each assumption', 'rating': 6}, {'name': 'LaTeX formatting 