ous set', 'description': 'GPT 5.2 includes a dedicated subsection (2c) explicitly proving that the constructed 1-homogeneous set H is dense in I and has order type η, while the SxS winner only briefly asserts density without detailed verification.', 'scale': '1-6 scale: 1-2 assertion without proof, 3-4 brief argument, 5-6 detailed verification with explicit handling of subintervals and endpoints', 'rating': 5}, {'name': 'Primitive recursive enumeration justification', 'description': 'GPT 5.2 explicitly notes that the enumeration of rational subintervals (J_k) needs no comprehension, highlighting metamathematical control over resources, which the SxS winner omits.', 'scale': '1-6 scale: 1-2 uses enumeration without comment, 3-4 mentions primitivity, 5-6 explicitly notes no comprehension is needed', 'rating': 4}, {'name': 'Clear separation of construction and verification phases', 'description': 'GPT 5.2 uses numbered sections and subsections (1, 2, 2a, 2b, 2c, 3) to separate definitions, construction, and verification, while the SxS winner mixes these in a continuous narrative with less structural organization.', 'scale': '1-6 scale: 1-2 minimal structure, 3-4 some sectioning, 5-6 clear hierarchical organization with explicit phase separation', 'rating': 4}], 'sxs_winner_label': 'Response A', 'token_usage': {'gemini': {'input_tokens': 0, 'output_tokens': 0, 'cached_tokens': 0, 'cost_usd': 0.0}, 'openai': {'input_tokens': 0, 'output_tokens': 0, 'cached_tokens': 0, 'cost_usd': 0.0}, 'kimi': {'input_tokens': 28105, 'output_tokens': 4123, 'cached_tokens': 0, 'cost_usd': 0.105686}, 'total_cost_usd': 0.105686}, 'token_usage_cumulative': {'gemini': {'input_tokens': 0, 'output_tokens': 0, 'cached_tokens': 0, 'cost_usd': 0.0}, 'openai': {'input_tokens': 0, 'output_tokens': 0, 'cached_tokens': 0, 'cost_usd': 0.0}, 'kimi': {'input_tokens': 28105, 'output_tokens': 4123, 'cached_tokens': 0, 'cost_usd': 0.105686}, 'total_cost_usd': 0.105686}}] 
