ion for choosing denominators 43 and 47 before diving into calculations.", 'scale': '1-6 scale: how well this aspect was performed in the comparison', 'rating': 5}, {'name': 'Dedicated verification section', 'description': "GPT 5.2 includes a standalone section titled '## Verification of the subtraction' that explicitly recomputes the difference to confirm equality with 1/2021.", 'scale': '1-6 scale: how well this aspect was performed in the comparison', 'rating': 5}, {'name': 'Explicit irreducibility verification', 'description': "GPT 5.2 contains a dedicated '## Irreducibility checks (gcd tests)' section with numbered steps explicitly proving gcd(11,43)=1 and gcd(12,47)=1 using primality arguments.", 'scale': '1-6 scale: how well this aspect was performed in the comparison', 'rating': 6}, {'name': 'Clear section hierarchy with markdown headers', 'description': "GPT 5.2 uses consistent hierarchical markdown headers (### for subsections, ## for major sections) creating explicit visual structure versus the winner's numbered steps with bold labels.", 'scale': '1-6 scale: how well this aspect was performed in the comparison', 'rating': 4}, {'name': 'Explicit variable naming convention', 'description': "GPT 5.2 uses uppercase letters (A, B, C, D) consistently for variables in the setup, matching standard conventions for Diophantine equations, versus the winner's lowercase mixing.", 'scale': '1-6 scale: how well this aspect was performed in the comparison', 'rating': 3}, {'name': 'Complete Euclidean algorithm display', 'description': "GPT 5.2 shows all three division steps of the Euclidean algorithm on separate lines with clear alignment, versus the winner's compressed single-line format with semicolons.", 'scale': '1-6 scale: how well this aspect was performed in the comparison', 'rating': 4}, {'name': 'Back-substitution clarity', 'description': "GPT 5.2 explicitly labels the back-substitution phase with 'Back-substitute:' and shows intermediate substitution steps line-