ete calculation.', 'scale': '1-6: 1-2 marginally better, 3-4 noticeably better with clear evidence, 5-6 substantially better', 'rating': 4}, {'name': 'Worst-case boundary analysis', 'description': 'Gemini 3 Pro explicitly analyzes the worst-case scenario where q_E = E/2 (when E ≡ 2 mod 4) and derives the inequality conditions for odd and even n separately.', 'scale': '1-6: 1-2 marginally better, 3-4 noticeably better with clear evidence, 5-6 substantially better', 'rating': 4}, {'name': 'LaTeX formatting quality', 'description': 'Gemini 3 Pro uses proper LaTeX delimiters ($...$ and $$...$$) with correct mathematical notation including \\text{LCM}, \\max, \\gcd, and aligned equation environments.', 'scale': '1-6: 1-2 marginally better, 3-4 noticeably better with clear evidence, 5-6 substantially better', 'rating': 3}, {'name': 'Structural organization with explicit headers', 'description': 'Gemini 3 Pro uses clear hierarchical headers (Key Structural Property, Case 1, Case 2, Sub-case A/B, Conclusion) with visual separators (---) between major sections.', 'scale': '1-6: 1-2 marginally better, 3-4 noticeably better with clear evidence, 5-6 substantially better', 'rating': 3}], 'rubrics_vs_gpt': [], 'sxs_winner_label': 'Response A', 'token_usage': {'gemini': {'input_tokens': 0, 'output_tokens': 0, 'cached_tokens': 0, 'cost_usd': 0.0}, 'openai': {'input_tokens': 0, 'output_tokens': 0, 'cached_tokens': 0, 'cost_usd': 0.0}, 'kimi': {'input_tokens': 23275, 'output_tokens': 3685, 'cached_tokens': 0, 'cost_usd': 0.09077}, 'total_cost_usd': 0.09077}, 'token_usage_cumulative': {'gemini': {'input_tokens': 0, 'output_tokens': 0, 'cached_tokens': 0, 'cost_usd': 0.0}, 'openai': {'input_tokens': 0, 'output_tokens': 0, 'cached_tokens': 0, 'cost_usd': 0.0}, 'kimi': {'input_tokens': 23275, 'output_tokens': 3685, 'cached_tokens': 0, 'cost_usd': 0.09077}, 'total_cost_usd': 0.09077}}] 
