ntain the same strategy outline, identical section structure (1-8), identical Lemma statements and proofs, identical equations with matching tags (1)-(4), identical Zorn matrix model with the same rank 4 and rank 6 examples, and identical concluding summary. The mathematical content, notation, and even formatting (use of \\(\\) vs \\( \\) for inline math) are indistinguishable. Both correctly prove: (a) construction of 7-dimensional Aut(C)-invariant subspace M via ω_x(u,v)=⟨x,uv⟩, (b) rank 6 for division algebras using T_x^2 identity, (c) rank 4 or 6 for split algebras with Witt index argument, and (d) explicit Zorn examples. No errors, omissions, or stylistic variations were detected between the two responses.'}, 'rubrics_vs_gemini': [], 'rubrics_vs_gpt': [], 'sxs_winner_label': 'Response A', 'token_usage': {'gemini': {'input_tokens': 0, 'output_tokens': 0, 'cached_tokens': 0, 'cost_usd': 0.0}, 'openai': {'input_tokens': 0, 'output_tokens': 0, 'cached_tokens': 0, 'cost_usd': 0.0}, 'kimi': {'input_tokens': 53607, 'output_tokens': 4130, 'cached_tokens': 0, 'cost_usd': 0.156774}, 'total_cost_usd': 0.156774}, 'token_usage_cumulative': {'gemini': {'input_tokens': 0, 'output_tokens': 0, 'cached_tokens': 0, 'cost_usd': 0.0}, 'openai': {'input_tokens': 0, 'output_tokens': 0, 'cached_tokens': 0, 'cost_usd': 0.0}, 'kimi': {'input_tokens': 53607, 'output_tokens': 4130, 'cached_tokens': 0, 'cost_usd': 0.156774}, 'total_cost_usd': 0.156774}}] 
